WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:29.980
Gemini Omni 1.2 Flash handles longer video clips on edge devices at lower cost than prior Gemini versions. This is Models &amp; Agents, Episode 226. Kakao's decision model, recursive sparse attention, and agent safety findings follow, then things to try. Google on its blog, aim the faster release at developers who need efficient inference on resource constrained devices, while keeping strong reasoning on extended contexts. Early users say it holds quality on work that previously needed

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:35.640
needed larger Gemini variants, so on-device agents can process long documents and multimodal

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.720
clips without stepping up a size class.

00:00:38.677 --> 00:00:43.277
Kakao, Harold Corp Reports, announced a decision model that answers typical requests

00:00:43.277 --> 00:00:48.937
in 183 milliseconds and runs 43 times faster than GPT-6 Luna.

00:00:49.497 --> 00:00:56.157
It matches or exceeds several larger models on Decision Index 0.4.1 and Decision Bench version

00:00:56.157 --> 00:00:56.597
4.

00:00:56.597 --> 00:01:03.077
The family ship says open 8 billion, 9 billion, 35 billion, with 3 billion active, and

00:01:03.077 --> 00:01:08.257
27 billion parameter variants, trained with supervised fine-tuning plus reinforcement

00:01:08.257 --> 00:01:14.190
learning from adjusted feedback, recursive sparse attention, posted on archive, builds

00:01:14.190 --> 00:01:19.590
a tree over the key value cache so each query reads only on the order of log L entries at

00:01:19.590 --> 00:01:26.310
context length L. Started from QN34B and trained on 0.62 billion tokens,

00:01:26.310 --> 00:01:33.230
REC SA scores 60.5 on ruler at 1 million tokens versus 40.0 for the best baseline.

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:41.910
Pre-Fill speeds up 3.2 times and decoding 3.8 times at 524,000 tokens on 1H-200 GPU.

00:01:42.956 --> 00:01:47.336
Plattour connects frozen large and small models through lightweight linear bridges trained

00:01:47.336 --> 00:01:48.656
only with task rewards.

00:01:49.296 --> 00:01:53.736
Controlled experiments showed some reported gains can be reproduced without useful sender

00:01:53.736 --> 00:01:54.276
information.

00:01:54.276 --> 00:01:58.976
So, the authors released PACCHEC to measure genuine cross-model communication.

00:02:00.093 --> 00:02:06.693
Hybrid soft prompt tuning on Fairbought Bench raised agreement with human ratings on bias, toxicity, and personalization.

00:02:07.233 --> 00:02:13.333
The adapted QN 3.59B judge surpassed hosted reference judges across those three dimensions.

00:02:14.496 --> 00:02:24.296
Attackers, IT brief New Zealand reports, register expired domains previously used by agent tools and serve malicious content that agents fetch during routine operation.

00:02:24.296 --> 00:02:28.476
The Webhole technique needs no prompt injection at deployment time.

00:02:29.447 --> 00:02:34.687
AtSign edge AI, Enterprise Times reports, provides encrypted identity-based connections

00:02:34.687 --> 00:02:38.207
for agents running at the edge without exposing long-lived credentials.

00:02:38.847 --> 00:02:43.967
The service targets enterprise deployments that need agent-to-agent or agent-to-device links.

00:02:44.944 --> 00:02:50.804
Autonomous agents, Microsoft said in an advisory carried by Homeland 411, can be prompted

00:02:50.804 --> 00:02:56.064
to enumerate and exfiltrate cloud credentials in under five minutes when given broad tool access.

00:02:56.784 --> 00:03:01.884
The advisory urges lease-privileged tool scopes and continuous monitoring of agent actions.

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:10.380
Safetyin, back on archive, is a clinician-informed benchmark of 32,555 simulated conversations

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:18.920
that found a 43.3% safety criterion failure rate without teen-aware prompting and 24.9% with it.

00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:25.780
Failures on diagnosis and medication boundaries rose 10-12 points when a simulated teenager pushed back.

00:03:26.597 --> 00:03:30.897
German, Korean, Turkish, and Farsi now sit inside Tao Bench Lilt,

00:03:31.317 --> 00:03:36.337
which extends Tao 3 bench across airline, retail, telecom, and banking domains.

00:03:36.757 --> 00:03:43.577
The largest performance drops versus English reach 61 points in pass 4 on Korean and Farsi retail tasks.

00:03:43.577 --> 00:03:43.677
6.

00:03:44.602 --> 00:03:50.662
Matriarchy Classics ships a tokenizer and mapping pipeline that gender swaps public domain novels

00:03:50.662 --> 00:03:53.402
while guaranteeing that only gendered words change.

00:03:53.902 --> 00:03:58.502
The method cuts manual effort from weeks to minutes and comes with code and two example

00:03:58.502 --> 00:03:58.962
novels.

00:04:00.007 --> 00:04:04.407
The fine-tune model plugs into the open-source lingua-haru document translator.

00:04:05.147 --> 00:04:10.227
Axis Laura puts four Laura branches inside an embedding model, gated per query.

00:04:10.227 --> 00:04:18.467
4. Benchmark mean recall at 10 improved by 1.28 to 1.56 points on personal memory tasks while

00:04:18.467 --> 00:04:24.151
training only a small fraction of parameters. Core is a training-free research harness that

00:04:24.151 --> 00:04:29.971
reuses late interaction re-ranker scores to return only the most relevant snippet from each retrieved

00:04:29.971 --> 00:04:36.591
passage and lets agents expand context on demand. It outperformed prior research harnesses on three

00:04:36.591 --> 00:04:42.159
agent models and three benchmarks. From the rest of today's papers, interactive backdoor

00:04:42.159 --> 00:04:47.039
attacks, poison training data, so multi-turn dialogue steers toward attacker goals after

00:04:47.039 --> 00:04:52.999
a trigger, while normal utility holds on psychological counseling tasks. Correcting score errors

00:04:52.999 --> 00:04:58.499
raised model acceptance by more than 80 points on legal bench Sara numeric cases without changing

00:04:58.499 --> 00:05:05.579
references or responses. Prism screened 3.9 million posts and surfaced 123 candidate genetic

00:05:05.579 --> 00:05:11.359
variant reclassifications. Five of them from uncertain to pathogenic or likely pathogenic.

00:05:12.039 --> 00:05:18.099
Feedback to 1,030 volunteer SAT tutors raised eliciting and uptake moves 8-15 percent,

00:05:18.619 --> 00:05:24.799
but left tutor talktime at 91.5 percent across conditions. Persistent memory written during low

00:05:24.799 --> 00:05:30.099
stakes coding or emotional support sessions caused agents to skip verification or exhibit sick

00:05:30.099 --> 00:05:33.779
fancy on later high stakes tasks across six frontier models.

00:05:34.419 --> 00:05:39.439
Trace MRT, red teaming exposed substantial vulnerabilities in top chain of thought monitors,

00:05:40.059 --> 00:05:46.739
and a new Bayesian trajectory monitor reached 0.91 area under the curve and 0.74 true positive

00:05:46.739 --> 00:05:48.979
rate at 5% false positive rate.

00:05:49.579 --> 00:05:54.359
Fine-tuning on the Speech Accessibility Project challenged two data cat character error rate

00:05:54.359 --> 00:06:01.359
from 15.26% to 7.81% on the hidden test set, with the largest gains on the hardest speakers.

00:06:02.059 --> 00:06:08.779
Pruning 25% of experts using English calibration dropped Lithuanian comprehension 21.4 points,

00:06:09.119 --> 00:06:11.559
while English fell only 1.7 points.

00:06:12.139 --> 00:06:19.159
Supervised fine-tuning reduced expected calibration error from 0.2 to 0.006 on a Luxembourgish

00:06:19.159 --> 00:06:27.819
next-like prediction task, while raising accuracy from 0.536-0.758. Genver, which scores triples

00:06:27.819 --> 00:06:35.859
against generated natural language representations, reached 88.56-91.52% accuracy on four-fact

00:06:35.859 --> 00:06:42.139
FB variants. A key phrase survey synthesizes statistical, hybrid, and LLM-based methods,

00:06:42.559 --> 00:06:47.339
and flags data scarcity and multimodal fusion as remaining bottlenecks for spoken language

00:06:47.339 --> 00:06:52.799
extraction. A generative simulation and human reading time data both show that unresolved

00:06:52.799 --> 00:06:58.399
dependency load, integration cost, and semantic mismatch jointly predict where listeners play

00:06:58.399 --> 00:07:03.939
sentence boundaries. Hybrid state transfer preserves recurrent and convolution states when moving

00:07:03.939 --> 00:07:12.179
context between hybrid models, achieving 89.88 to 94.11 percent task retention at 21 times

00:07:12.179 --> 00:07:13.139
hand-off speed-up.

00:07:13.739 --> 00:07:20.019
Hallouchex 42,000 instance benchmark shows current LLMs handle basic detection, but struggle

00:07:20.019 --> 00:07:23.819
with localization, correction, and agent trajectory hallucinations.

00:07:24.399 --> 00:07:30.759
TB math model scores complete modeling solutions against human outstanding papers, plus lean verified

00:07:30.759 --> 00:07:33.979
feasibility constraints on 18 real contest problems.

00:07:33.979 --> 00:07:42.259
times. Multimodal SEA, across 608 tasks, saw a tax success rates from 7.1 to 34.5 percent,

00:07:42.819 --> 00:07:49.099
and adding multimodal content raised success from 19.9 percent to 29.2 percent, despite

00:07:49.099 --> 00:07:54.639
more verification attempts. South Africa, the national reports, ranks among only three

00:07:54.639 --> 00:07:57.259
African countries meeting the AI readiness benchmark.

